Q: I have created Terraform code for the first time. There is no .tfstate file. What happens when I run terraform plan?
Expected flow:
Terraform code
      ↓
terraform plan
      ↓
Provider checks actual infrastructure
      ↓
Terraform determines what needs to be created
      ↓
Plan displayed

Then:
terraform apply
      ↓
Infrastructure created
      ↓
Terraform creates/updates terraform.tfstate
